.TH MX-REMASTERCC 1 "August 2026" "mx-remastercc 26.03" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mx-remastercc \- manage MX Linux remastering and live persistence
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mx-remastercc
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mx-remastercc
is a graphical control center for MX Linux live-system remastering and
persistence tools.
It provides shortcuts for setting up and configuring live persistence,
saving root persistence, and starting the remaster utility.
.PP
The remastering and persistence operations are intended for use in an MX
Linux live session.
Actions that modify the live system request administrative privileges.
.SH OPTIONS
This program does not accept command-line options.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/mx-remastercc/mx-remastercc.html
Offline help.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR live-remaster (1),
.BR persist-config (1),
.BR persist-makefs (1),
.BR persist-save (1)
.SH AUTHOR
MX Linux contributors.
